WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.709 --> 00:00:02.700
I bet you’re wondering 
what is next.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.000
(music playing)

00:00:05.172 --> 00:00:06.757
We will create something
important.

00:00:11.887 --> 00:00:12.888
It looks fabulous.

00:00:12.888 --> 00:00:13.889
I can’t wait to see it.

00:00:17.893 --> 00:00:18.851
What’s up, dog?

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:19.269
Hey!

00:00:24.107 --> 00:00:25.734
This is where I belong.

00:00:27.486 --> 00:00:29.488
This is a show. I love it.

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.782
It’s fun. Different. Sparkly.

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:38.163
Hey there - did you miss me?

00:00:39.623 --> 00:00:40.374
What?

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:43.085
Perhaps we let our future be
greater.

00:00:43.335 --> 00:00:44.044
It could change everything.

